[version]
1.3.3
[date]
2026-10-21
[whatsnew]
- FIXED: CraftOS now boots from bootloader without interruption
  - Bootloader returns to menu after kernel exits (was hanging before)
  - craftos-shim.lua recognized as script-type kernel (not just function)
- NEW: Web Browser (usr/bin/webbrowser.lua)
  - Fetch and display web pages via HTTP API
  - HTML to text conversion (strips tags, decodes entities)
  - URL input with arrow-key history
  - Bookmarks (Ctrl+D to add, 'b' to view)
  - DuckDuckGo Lite search ('s' to search)
  - Page scrolling (Page Up/Down, arrows)
  - Save current page to file (Ctrl+S)
  - Back/Forward navigation (left/right arrows)
- NEW: Internet connection checker (bin/internet.lua)
  - 'internet' - check if HTTP works (tests example.com, github.com)
  - 'internet enable' - show step-by-step server config instructions
  - 'internet test' - run connectivity tests
  - Detects attached modems and explains how to connect them
- Bootloader: kernel-exit returns to GRUB menu (no more hanging)
- Plasma Kicker: added Web Browser to app launcher
- Help: added internet and webbrowser commands
[/whatsnew]
[files]
bootloader/bootloader.lua
usr/bin/webbrowser.lua
bin/internet.lua
bin/help.lua
de/plasma.lua
installer.lua
latest_update.upd
[/files]
